            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "smithki"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is a family favorite. Every get together we have where we are to bring an appetizer, this is expected. Sometimes it is a little thick. When that happens, I just add a little milk to it until it is the consistency that I am looking for.",
